      "lineNbr": 1968,
      "author": {
        "id": 1081638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-28T00:42:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "null when it\u0027s transferred to the other DC. Since one DC can serve multiple connect request from different ApnContext, it\u0027s possible during handover, the dc still takes connect event from other ApnContext. Ideally this network request should be transferred to the new DCT as well, so probably will not happen I think.",
